   "ArticlePublicNumber": "KA-01062",
   "Title": "Blocked Driveway",
   "Description": "Report a vehicle that is blocking your driveway.",
   "Section": [
    {
     "Name": "911 Blocked Driveway",
     "Content": "<style type=\"text/css\">.divTable {\n                display: table;\n                width: 100%;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.divTableRow {\n                display: table-row;\n}\n.divTableCell1, .divTableHead {\n                border: 0px solid #cccccc;\n                display: table-cell;\n                padding: 6px 12px;\n                background-color: red;\n                color: white;\n                font-weight: bold;\n                text-align: center;\n}\n.divTableCell2, .divTableHead {\n                border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n                display: table-cell;\n                padding: 12px 12px;\n                background-color: #eeeeee;\n}\n.divTableBody {\n                display: table-row-group;\n}</style><div class=\"divTable\"><div class=\"divTableBody\"><div class=\"divTableRow\"><div class=\"divTableCell1\">Call 911</div></div><div class=\"divTableRow\"><div class=\"divTableCell2\">Call <span style=\"color:#FF0004\"><strong>911</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\">to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">report a vehicle illegally parked in the actual driveway of private property. This is considered trespassing.</span></div></div></div></div><ul></ul><div style=\"background:#eee;border:1px solid #ccc;padding:5px 10px; margin-bottom:15px;\"><p><em><strong>Need something else?</strong></em></p><ul><li><a class=\"kalink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://portal.311.nyc.gov/article/?kanumber=KA-02130\">Abandoned Vehicle</a></li><li><a class=\"kalink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://portal.311.nyc.gov/article/?kanumber=KA-01986\">Illegal Parking</a></li><li><a class=\"kalink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://portal.311.nyc.gov/article/?kanumber=KA-02055\">Towed Vehicle</a>&nbsp;</li></ul></div><p>You can report a vehicle that is partially or completely blocking your driveway.</p><p>Include in your report the vehicle&#39;s:</p><ul><li>Color</li><li>Make</li><li>Model</li><li>License plate number</li></ul><p><strong>What Happens Next</strong></p><p>The police may ticket the vehicle. If the vehicle has a ticket and you want it moved, you can call a private towing company or ask the local police precinct to contact &quot;rotation tow.&quot; The owner of the vehicle will have to pay any towing fees.</p><p><a class=\"externallink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nyc.gov/site/nypd/bureaus/patrol/find-your-precinct.page\">Find a precinct or police service area (PSA) by address or zip code.</a></p><p><a class=\"externallink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nyc.gov/site/nypd/bureaus/patrol/precincts-landing.page\">Find a precinct by name.</a></p><p><a class=\"externallink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nyc.gov/site/nypd/bureaus/transit-housing/housing.page\">Find a PSA by name.</a></p>",
